/ A call's parameter is the callee's own: it doesn't outlive the call, and a caller's variable of the same
/ name is the caller's again after it.
Start
- set %city% = "Oslo"
- call Visit city="Reykjavik", unit="metric"
- assert %visited% equals "Reykjavik", "the goal ran with its argument"
- assert %city% equals "Oslo", "the caller's own %city% is its own again"
- assert %unit% is null, "the parameter ends with the call"

Visit
- set %visited% = %city%
